  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ooh... a cute little village!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360123630747653
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 60ea9b9b32e080545889c83175fb2aa1, type: 2}
    dialog: You rotten child! You broke the spade <NoiseText=3,1>again</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360123630747654
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ab7d101875574da4aaab44bf5b30f3f7, type: 2}
    dialog: Father, it- it was already wobbly-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360123630747655
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 60ea9b9b32e080545889c83175fb2aa1, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't you talk back to me!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Lemkil smacks the daughter who allegedly broke the spade across the face.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360123630747656
    - rid: 4972360123630747657
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ab7d101875574da4aaab44bf5b30f3f7, type: 2}
    dialog: Ow-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: There was another girl with them, who ran off to a building- maybe her
      house?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 60ea9b9b32e080545889c83175fb2aa1, type: 2}
    dialog: Worthless daughters of mine...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Nevermind. Not cute.)
    ScreenActions:
