  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Haahh... haahh... I should probably take a break-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (-!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147915
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori seems to have noticed the ransacked carriage.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147916
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (This place sucks!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147917
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Why would {mc} even want to come here?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147918
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Poor pony, poor people...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147919
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Aren't there supposed to be guards and stuff? What the heck are they
      doing?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147920
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Parents beating their kids, bandits building forts, death just about
      everywhere-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147921
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (... speaking of guards...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147922
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I haven't seen one in a while, am I still even going the right way?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931147923
